Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 20:10:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] eagler: Show an Eagler server's pause menu buttons

EaglerXServer's pause_menu.yml gives the menu a server info button and a
Discord button. Incari's ServerPauseMenu adds them below the row of icon
buttons.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
index 52546a6e322ccbe79c24d5d3893a57fad27be3ef..02aeb84f1c331aa080a5041fbc7e137d8b13884d 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/screens/PauseScreen.java
@@ -156,2 +156,5 @@
         helper.addChild(iconButtonRow, 2, gridLayout.newCellSettings().alignHorizontallyCenter());
+        // Incari start: an Eagler server's own buttons (its pause_menu.yml)
+        incari.client.eagler.PauseMenuHooks.addButtons(helper);
+        // Incari end
         Optional<? extends Holder<Dialog>> additions = this.getCustomAdditions();
